From 8545fc6394265097f40f3135d50040c498ea772e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:30:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] fix(reconciler): pass the accelerator request to the
 scheduler

_compute_diff always sent empty requirements, so a scheduler could not
tell how many devices of which type an InferenceService asked for.
Extract spec.resources.accelerator (type, count, minMemoryGiB) into
requirements["accelerator"]; resources without a typed accelerator
request (base Resource, unregistered kinds) keep empty requirements.
